<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT-Australian All Ordinaries overbought but higher.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Australian All Ordinaries overbought but higher.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>------------------------All Ordinaries----------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 2620 2650 2680 *RSI-14 80.38 *MA-10 2566.7</p>
<p>2570 - 2625  *Sup 2590 2570 2535 *MA-20 2543.7 *MA-40 2487.5</p>
<p>---------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - June 2-------------</p>
<p>*Over extended rally continues</p>
<p>*Still in uptrend - but for how long</p>
<p>*Overbought</p>
<p>*All Ordinaries 2.8 points up at 2,613.4 at midday Monday</p>
<p>The Australian All Ordinaries is higher again, and through the psychological 2,600 level.</p>
<p>Traders will most likely use this as a pivot point.</p>
</text>
